### ─────────────────────────────────────────
###  DEALER FORM  (/api/dealerform)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Create Dealer Form
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dealerform/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "John Smith",
    "email": "john@example.com",
    "businessName": "Smith Logistics",
    "businessEmail": "contact@smithlogistics.com",
    "phoneNumber": "514-555-0200",
    "city": "Montreal",
    "postalCode": "H2X 1Y6",
    "status": "Pending"
}

###

### Get All Dealer Forms  [AuthGuard + SuperAdminGuard]
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dealerform/all

###

### Get Dealer Form By Id  [AuthGuard + SuperAdminGuard]
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dealerform/find/1

###

### Update Dealer Form  [AuthGuard + SuperAdminGuard]
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/dealerform/update/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "Accepted"
}

###

### Delete Dealer Form  [AuthGuard + SuperAdminGuard]
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/dealerform/1
